        "gg-__Llz-UA_text": "<p>A classic everyday hat known for comfort and breathability.</p><ul><li>Adjustable snapback closure for a perfect fit&nbsp;</li><li>Made with 6 structured panels for a traditional shape&nbsp;</li><li>Features a mesh back that allows air to flow and keeps you cool, especially outdoors.&nbsp;</li><li>Lightweight and available in a wide variety of colors</li></ul>"
